#: src/10-architecture.md:154
msgid ""
"Each submodule has its own remote, its own pull requests and its own default "
"branch, and the chain is merged bottom-up: a pointer here may only name a "
"commit reachable from that submodule's default branch, and a CI check "
"enforces it."
msgstr ""
"Cada submódulo tem seu próprio remote, seus próprios pull requests e seu "
